#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:3124
msgid "Cost of Goods"
msgstr "Coste de mercancía"

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:629
msgid "How Cost of Goods is calculated"
msgstr "Cómo se calcula el coste de mercancía"

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:630
msgid ""
"The \"Cost of goods\" you set on each product, multiplied by the quantity "
"sold in paid orders for the period. Variations use their own cost and fall "
"back to the parent product. Any product with no cost set counts as zero, "
"which overstates Net profit, so fill those in for an accurate margin."
msgstr ""
"El \"Coste de mercancía\" que estableces en cada producto, multiplicado por "
"la cantidad vendida en pedidos pagados del periodo. Las variaciones usan su "
"propio coste y recurren al producto principal. Cualquier producto sin coste "
"establecido cuenta como cero, lo que infla el beneficio neto, así que "
"complétalos para obtener un margen preciso."

#. translators: %s: percentage of revenue.
#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:638
#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:3126
#: front-end/expenses/brikpanel-expenses.php:66
#: front-end/navigation/brikpanel-navigation.php:207
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:1532
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:2010
#: includes/brikpanel-store-summary.php:2018
msgid "Expenses"
msgstr "Gastos"

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:640
msgid "What Expenses includes"
msgstr "Qué incluyen los gastos"

#: front-end/dashboard/brikpanel-dashboard.php:641
msgid ""
"Operating costs for the period: order tax, ad spend from connected ad "
"platforms (store currency only), supplier and stock costs from received "
"purchase orders, plus anything logged in the Expenses module. Open the "
"breakdown to see each part."
msgstr ""
"Costes operativos del periodo: impuestos de pedidos, gasto en publicidad de "
"las plataformas conectadas (solo en la moneda de la tienda), costes de "
"proveedores y de stock de los pedidos de compra recibidos, además de "
"cualquier cosa registrada en el módulo de Gastos. Abre el desglose para ver "
