msgid "BrikPanel Access"
msgstr "Acceso de BrikPanel"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:238
msgid "You do not have permission to change these settings."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para cambiar estos ajustes."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:302
msgid "You do not have permission to view this page."
msgstr "No tienes permiso para ver esta página."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:334
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "Ajustes guardados."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:335
msgid ""
"The new access rules take effect immediately on every site in the network."
msgstr ""
"Las nuevas reglas de acceso entran en vigor inmediatamente en cada sitio de "
"la red."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:344
msgid "Network-wide access control"
msgstr "Control de acceso en toda la red"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:346
msgid ""
"By default every subsite administrator and shop manager can use BrikPanel "
"because they hold the manage_woocommerce capability. Turn this on to "
"restrict BrikPanel to a specific set of roles across the whole network."
msgstr ""
"Por defecto, cada administrador de subsitio y gestor de tienda puede usar "
"BrikPanel porque posee la capacidad manage_woocommerce. Activa esto para "
"restringir BrikPanel a un conjunto específico de roles en toda la red."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:351
msgid "Restrict BrikPanel access on subsites"
msgstr "Restringir el acceso a BrikPanel en subsitios"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:358
msgid ""
"When off (default), nothing changes — BrikPanel works for every site admin "
"and shop manager as usual. When on, only users whose role appears in the "
"list below see the BrikPanel UI, settings tab, and AJAX endpoints."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está desactivado (predeterminado), nada cambia: BrikPanel funciona "
"para cada administrador del sitio y gestor de tienda como siempre. Cuando "
"está activado, solo los usuarios cuyo rol aparezca en la lista de abajo "
"verán la interfaz de BrikPanel, la pestaña de ajustes y los endpoints AJAX."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:365
msgid "Roles allowed to use BrikPanel"
msgstr "Roles autorizados a usar BrikPanel"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:367
msgid ""
"Pick the roles whose users may access BrikPanel features on subsites. "
"Network Super Admins are always allowed, regardless of this list."
msgstr ""
"Elige los roles cuyos usuarios pueden acceder a las funciones de BrikPanel "
"en los subsitios. Los superadministradores de la red siempre están "
"autorizados, independientemente de esta lista."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:389
msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Siempre activado"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:400
msgid "Lock BrikPanel settings on subsites"
msgstr "Bloquear los ajustes de BrikPanel en los subsitios"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:402
msgid ""
"When on, subsite owners can still use BrikPanel (dashboard, reports, product "
"and coupon tools) but cannot open or change the BrikPanel settings tab. Only "
"the subsites you grant below — and Network Super Admins — may manage "
"BrikPanel settings."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activado, los propietarios de subsitios pueden seguir usando "
"BrikPanel (dashboard, informes, herramientas de productos y cupones) pero no "
"pueden abrir ni cambiar la pestaña de ajustes de BrikPanel. Solo los "
"subsitios que autorices a continuación, y los superadministradores de la "
"red, podrán gestionar los ajustes de BrikPanel."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:407
msgid "Lock the BrikPanel settings tab on subsites"
msgstr "Bloquear la pestaña de ajustes de BrikPanel en los subsitios"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:414
msgid ""
"Off by default — turning this on never affects how BrikPanel works "
"elsewhere, it only hides and blocks the settings tab for subsites that are "
"not granted below."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto: activar esto nunca afecta a cómo funciona BrikPanel "
"en otros lugares, solo oculta y bloquea la pestaña de ajustes para los "
"subsitios que no estén autorizados abajo."

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:421
msgid "Subsites allowed to manage BrikPanel settings"
msgstr "Subsitios autorizados a gestionar los ajustes de BrikPanel"

#: includes/brikpanel-network-access.php:423
msgid ""
"Only used when the lock above is on. Tick a subsite to let its "
"administrators open and change the BrikPanel settings tab on that site. "
"Super Admins always have access regardless of this list."
msgstr ""
"Solo se usa cuando el bloqueo de arriba está activado. Marca un subsitio "
"para permitir que sus administradores abran y cambien la pestaña de ajustes "
"de BrikPanel en ese sitio. Los superadministradores siempre tienen acceso "
"independientemente de esta lista."

